### Layer 4b: PII masking - correct order (mask runs before the logger)
### Watch the console: the logged request is already masked.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pii/masked-before-log?message=My name is Dan Vega (dan.vega@yahoo.com) and my card 4111 1111 1111 1111 was double charged, can you help me?

### Layer 4b: PII masking - wrong order (logger forced to run first)
### Watch the console: the raw email and card number are logged even though
### the caller still gets a masked/clean response.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pii/logger-runs-first?message=My name is Dan Vega (dan.vega@yahoo.com) and my card 4111 1111 1111 1111 was double charged, can you help me?
